<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS2" title="In Appendix B Reasoning Types as Design Motivation ‣ Interpretable-by-Design Transformers via Architectural Stream Independence" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.2 </span>Inductive Pattern Discovery (Circuits)</span></a></li>
